e; being or due to be put into action. — Of a person, used to express agreement to or acceptance of a proposal or challenge made by that person; most commonly with subject \"you\" (see you're on).","example":"\"Five bucks says the Cavs win tonight.\" ―\"You're on!\"","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792284915043,"id":"on|adjective|3","lemma":"on","norm":"on","pos":"adjective","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","tag:informal","tag:not-comparable","pos_raw:adj"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":2,"word":"on"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(not-comparable) Fitted; covering or being worn.","example":"Your feet will soon warm up once your socks are on.","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792284915043,"id":"on|adjective|4","lemma":"on","norm":"on","pos":"adjective","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","tag:not-comparable","pos_raw:adj"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":2,"word":"on"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(not-comparable, postpositional) Of a stated part of something, oriented towards the viewer or other specified direction.","example":"The photograph shows the UFO side on.","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792284915043,"id":"on|adjective|5","lemma":"on","norm":"on","pos":"adjective","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","tag:not-comparable","tag:postpositional","pos_raw:adj"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":2,"word":"on"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(uk, informal, not-comparable, in the negative) Acceptable, appropriate.","example":"It's not fair to do that – it's just not on.","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792284915043,"id":"on|adjective|6","lemma":"on","norm":"on","pos":"adjective","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","usage:region:british english","tag:uk","tag:informal","tag:not-comparable","rtag:in the negative","pos_raw:adj"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":2,"word":"on"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(not-comparable, in the negative) Possible; capable of being