_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792285133262,"id":"of|preposition|20","lemma":"of","norm":"of","pos":"preposition","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","pos_raw:prep"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":5,"word":"of"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(following a noun (now chiefly nouns of knowledge, communication etc.)) Introducing subject matter. — Introduces its subject matter; about, concerning.","example":"He told us the story of his journey to India.","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792285133262,"id":"of|preposition|21","lemma":"of","norm":"of","pos":"preposition","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","qual:following a noun (now chiefly nouns of knowledge, communication etc.)","pos_raw:prep"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":5,"word":"of"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(following an adjective) Introducing subject matter. — Introduces its subject matter.","example":"This behaviour is typical of teenagers.","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792285133262,"id":"of|preposition|22","lemma":"of","norm":"of","pos":"preposition","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","qual:following an adjective","pos_raw:prep"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":5,"word":"of"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(following a number or other quantitive word) Having partitive effect. — Introduces the whole for which is indicated only the specified part or segment; \"from among\".","example":"Most of these apples are rotten.","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792285133262,"id":"of|preposition|23","lemma":"of","norm":"of","pos":"preposition","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","qual:following a number or other quantitive word","pos_raw:prep"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":5,"word":"of"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(or as a predicate after to be, archaic, literary) Having partitive effect. — Some, an amount of, one of.","example":"On the whole, they seem to be of the decent sort.","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":179228